{# Front-Channel Logout 1.0 §2 and §3: once the session has ended, one frame per client that registered a
   front-channel logout URI, loaded by the browser that holds the cookies of those clients. This page does
   not extend the layout of the interaction plane, on purpose: it carries a step of the protocol rather
   than a page of the product, and its Content-Security-Policy is "default-src 'none'" with the frames and
   the one script named, which a layout bringing a stylesheet or a script of its own would break.

   What the page says is what the provider can promise: it asked the applications, it does not claim the
   user is signed out of them. A frame of another origin reaches its client only if the browser sends that
   client's cookies, and a browser that blocks third-party cookies does not.

   Whoever edits it keeps the script exactly as it is given: its hash is the policy. #}
{% trans_default_domain 'beffroi' %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ app.request.locale|replace({'_': '-'}) }}">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>{{ 'front_channel_logout.title'|trans }}</title>
    {% if continue_to is not null %}
        {# a browser that runs no script leaves on its own, after the same wait the script holds #}
        <noscript><meta http-equiv="refresh" content="{{ wait }};url={{ continue_to }}"></noscript>
    {% endif %}
</head>
<body>
    <main data-front-channel-logout="{{ frames|length }}">
        <h1>{{ 'front_channel_logout.title'|trans }}</h1>
        <p>{{ 'front_channel_logout.asked'|trans }}</p>
        {% if continue_to is null %}
            <p>{{ 'logged_out.close'|trans }}</p>
        {% else %}
            <p><a href="{{ continue_to }}">{{ 'front_channel_logout.continue'|trans }}</a></p>
        {% endif %}
    </main>
    {% for frame in frames %}
        <iframe src="{{ frame }}" width="0" height="0" title="{{ 'front_channel_logout.frame'|trans }}"></iframe>
    {% endfor %}
    {% if continue_to is not null %}
        <script>{{ script|raw }}</script>
    {% endif %}
</body>
</html>
